    "notes": "The Nifisha-Ismailia-Al Qantarah West-Port Said extension along the Canal’s west bank opened 1904.  [route] Intermediate stations from Wikipedia’s Egyptian station list; the source is alphabetical, so the sequence is ordered by geography here — verify the exact historical order around the eastern-Delta junction (Zagazig / Tell el-Kebir / Abu Hammad) and the canal-side stops.",
